      "content": "Valve's Steamworks Web API exposes a constellation of HTTP interfaces for\ngames, players, news, friends, achievements, and items. Public read-only\ninterfaces (with a Steam Web API key) are served from api.steampowered.com;\npublisher-restricted methods are served from partner.steam-api.com.\nEndpoints derived from https://steamcommunity.com/dev and the Steamworks\ndocumentation at https://partner.steamgames.com/doc/webapi.\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Steamworks Developer Portal",
